{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03602",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 5.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Morning, come on through. How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.85,
      "end_seconds": 21.13,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "Well, mainly a sore throat. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.49,
      "end_seconds": 26.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.34,
      "end_seconds": 31.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "About a six out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.37,
      "end_seconds": 40.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Has there been a faint rash on the chest too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.47,
      "end_seconds": 45.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had that since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.01,
      "end_seconds": 65.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.03,
      "end_seconds": 80.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.91,
      "end_seconds": 101.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 93, BP is 123 over 73, temp 38.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.7,
      "end_seconds": 105.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.71,
      "end_seconds": 115.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Right, they help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.22,
      "end_seconds": 120.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.81,
      "end_seconds": 122.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.76,
      "end_seconds": 124.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.78,
      "end_seconds": 143.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "There are small mouth ulcers, tender neck glands and a faint pink rash on the chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.59,
      "end_seconds": 145.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.91,
      "end_seconds": 157.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.17,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Any cough, stiff neck, diarrhoea or recent tick bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.67,
      "end_seconds": 166.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "Let me think, I haven't had cough, stiff neck, diarrhoea or recent tick bite, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.09,
      "end_seconds": 172.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.47,
      "end_seconds": 176.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.14,
      "end_seconds": 179.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.67,
      "end_seconds": 181.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.78,
      "end_seconds": 188.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Right, has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.07,
      "end_seconds": 193.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "My aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.6,
      "end_seconds": 196.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.15,
      "end_seconds": 200.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "I've had anxiety, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.71,
      "end_seconds": 208.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.44,
      "end_seconds": 213.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.69,
      "end_seconds": 218.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.94,
      "end_seconds": 223.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.74,
      "end_seconds": 226.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Alright, and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.54,
      "end_seconds": 231.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.8,
      "end_seconds": 236.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.31,
      "end_seconds": 242.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.25,
      "end_seconds": 259.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.87,
      "end_seconds": 264.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.02,
      "end_seconds": 267.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.3,
      "end_seconds": 272.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.97,
      "end_seconds": 282.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I'd lean towards an acute viral illness, possibly early HIV infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.7,
      "end_seconds": 287.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.97,
      "end_seconds": 309.57,
      "duration_seconds": 20.6,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an acute viral illness, possibly early HIV infection, but I'd like to confirm. I want a glandular fever test done, that's for sore throat and glands. I want a fourth-generation HIV test done, that's for acute viral illness with rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.66,
      "end_seconds": 313.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.87,
      "end_seconds": 341.96,
      "duration_seconds": 27.09,
      "text": "I'm offering an HIV test with every illness like this, it's routine, and results are confidential. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'll also refer you to the sexual health clinic. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. We'll catch up after the results. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.43,
      "end_seconds": 345.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}